{"name": "Where the Seeds Fall", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras_big/a29bb528687311ce3823616d8bb4ad41.webp?t=1793936543\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras/a29bb528687311ce3823616d8bb4ad41.avif?t=1793936543\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The earth has been afflicted with Blight, forcing humanity to build new homes upon the branches of the World Tree.<br/>It is a place fraught with peril, and in their fear, humanity has branded \"Fell Children\" as omens of disaster. After encountering a Fell Child, however, one soldier goes against orders and resolves to escort them to the surface world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras/6fade790bc47057206ec81cb502a12a3.poster.avif?t=1793936543\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras/6fade790bc47057206ec81cb502a12a3.webm?t=1793936543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras/6fade790bc47057206ec81cb502a12a3.mp4?t=1793936543\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras_big/c6b411fee2d93275835ade042ea3e457.webp?t=1793936543\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras/c6b411fee2d93275835ade042ea3e457.avif?t=1793936543\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate crumbling platforms, brace against strong winds, and make sure you land on steady ground. On the precarious branches of the World Tree, one misstep could spell your doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras/1602af6910d179a4cc6f20528f931685.poster.avif?t=1793936543\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras/1602af6910d179a4cc6f20528f931685.webm?t=1793936543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras/1602af6910d179a4cc6f20528f931685.mp4?t=1793936543\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras_big/75b006fa208ee232f8300c9f96e51bde.webp?t=1793936543\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras/75b006fa208ee232f8300c9f96e51bde.avif?t=1793936543\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Growing on the World Tree are unique flower buds you can pick up and carry. Throw them where you want to land to create flower blossoms that will absorb the impact of your otherwise deadly fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras/ea63e226f8c053107d03edda7194dfec.poster.avif?t=1793936543\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras/ea63e226f8c053107d03edda7194dfec.webm?t=1793936543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras/ea63e226f8c053107d03edda7194dfec.mp4?t=1793936543\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras_big/045325a81438a9e7400dc6f647acc1f8.webp?t=1793936543\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras/045325a81438a9e7400dc6f647acc1f8.avif?t=1793936543\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you explore the World Tree, uncover the truth behind the Fell Child to learn what\u2014and who\u2014your journey is truly about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras_big/8f1e296010ed9f1a41be12ed46c0d98e.avif?t=1793936543\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras/8f1e296010ed9f1a41be12ed46c0d98e.avif?t=1793936543\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras_big/1c213f22f007c499292c3dcd60ac0155.webp?t=1793936543\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras/1c213f22f007c499292c3dcd60ac0155.avif?t=1793936543\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a densely-packed narrative experience that can be finished in about 3 hours. After clearing the main story, continue challenging yourself with higher-difficulty maps and a time trial mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras/97d1a58aec1b68aca949e1319496ad88.poster.avif?t=1793936543\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras/97d1a58aec1b68aca949e1319496ad88.webm?t=1793936543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/extras/97d1a58aec1b68aca949e1319496ad88.mp4?t=1793936543\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Blight has infected the land, forcing humanity to live upon the branches of the World Tree. After a chance encounter with a strange child, your world begins to fall apart. Navigate ruins, read the wind, and take a leap of faith into this thrilling action-adventure game.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139580/66f0780fdaafb7743e3ada064763522633964c95/header.jpg?t=1793936543", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Atmospheric", "3D Platformer", "Parkour", "Adventure", "Third Person", "Difficult"], "developers": "CygamesEdge, ZEREO Inc.", "publishers": "CygamesEdge, ZEREO Inc.", "release_date": "Nov 4, 2026", "price": "$9.99", "appid": "4139580", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "5 November 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/ysjqFg9CCmI", "first_seen": 1793833200.0, "review_rank": 25}